  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the bamboo steamer over boiling water.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the smoked tofu, marjoram leaves, fermented beets, onions, garlic, caraway seeds, apple cider vinegar, olive oil, sugar, salt, and black pepper.",
